BT 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm /F2 10 Tf 13 TL (1. What is the difference between interpreted and compiled languages?) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 653.8047 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 16.4 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.8 TL (Interpreted language runs the code with the help of an interpreter. Compiled language first converts the program into) Tj T* (machine code by a compiler. Python is generally called an interpreted language and C is a compiled language.) Tj T* ET
