q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 16.4 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.8 TL (First we write risky code inside try. Then except is used to handle the error. else can be used when there is no error and) Tj T* (finally can be used for cleanup.) Tj T* ET
