q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 16.4 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 12.8 TL (It helps the program use memory properly. Good memory management can reduce unnecessary memory use and can) Tj T* (improve program performance.) Tj T* ET
